/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (Rare Beauty officially launched in September 2020 during the COVID-19 pandemic, exactly when TikTok and Instagram beauty content was exploding among people staying at home. This perfect timing allowed the brand to gain visibility at relatively low marketing cost, especially for products like the Soft Pinch Liquid Blush. Initial challenges included building consumer trust as a new celebrity brand in a market full of competition and scepticism.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
