/E (Charlotte Tilbury- focuses on luxury sculpted and contoured results at higher price points. It mainly targets prestige consumers who seek a professional, high-end makeup experience. However, this makes it less accessible for young or beginner users compared to the easy, everyday appeal of the Soft Pinch Liquid Blush.)
