/E (e.l.f. Cosmetics- delivers highly affordable options that attract budget-conscious buyers. While price is its biggest strength, it frequently lacks the premium texture and long-wearing performance that many customers expect. The Soft Pinch Liquid Blush manages to balance quality and accessibility better, justifying its premium positioning.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
