/P 60 0 R
/E (NARS- is known for its classic, strong pigmentation in traditional powder and stick formats. It appeals strongly to makeup professionals and enthusiasts who prefer bold, buildable colour. However, it does not offer the same effortless, natural liquid finish that has become popular among younger consumers today.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
