/E (Future entrepreneurs should learn the following important lessons from the Soft Pinch Liquid Blush success story. Each point offers practical guidance for building strong businesses.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 300 0 R
/E (Product Differentiation: Solve real user problems for strong positioning. The blush succeeded by offering easy blending and natural results that other products often lacked. Entrepreneurs should spend time understanding exact customer frustrations and create clear differences that make their product the obvious better choice.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (Brand Positioning: Align values with product for emotional connection. Rare Beauty linked the blush to inclusivity and mental health, making customers feel good about their purchase. New businesses should define clear brand values early and ensure every product reflects them consistently.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 302 0 R
/E (Consumer Psychology: Natural results and confidence drive loyalty. People kept buying the blush because it made them feel confident in their daily look. Entrepreneurs must study not just what customers need functionally but also what they feel emotionally when using the product.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 303 0 R
/E (Viral Marketing: UGC is powerful and low-cost. Real customer videos on TikTok spread the blush faster than paid ads could. Smart entrepreneurs should encourage and use genuine user content to build trust and reach.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 304 0 R
/E (Innovation: Iterate on what works. Rare Beauty kept improving the blush line based on feedback. Businesses should treat their flagship product as something to continuously refine rather than leave unchanged.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (Community Building: Purpose builds trust. The mental health fund created a loyal community around the blush. Entrepreneurs should incorporate meaningful purpose to turn customers into passionate supporters.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
